### 1. 加载默认配置（load-default）
### 根据配置名称从 SampleConfig 目录加载床位配置文件
POST http://localhost:5000/api/load-default
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ConfigName": "sample_6beds"
}


### 2. 加载用户自定义配置（load-by-user）
### 传入自定义 JSON 配置文件的完整路径，程序读取并加载到页面
POST http://localhost:5000/api/load-by-user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "FilePath": "D:\\BedsConfig\\user_defined1.json"
}
加载配置之后可以显示在UI上。

### 3. 直接传入床位配置（load-config）
### 将合法的床位配置 JSON 数据直接放在请求体中传递，无需指定文件路径
POST http://localhost:5000/api/load-config
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "BedCount": 3,
  "StaFolderPath": "D:\\S2From真机导出\\E202605071749_PETWBRAW_3_20260507175822",
  "Beds": [
    {
      "Id": 1,
      "Name": "Head",
      "Type": 8,
      "FilePath": "D:\\S2From真机导出\\E202605071749_PETWBRAW_3_20260507175822\\ListMode_BedPosition1",
      "IsEnabled": true,
      "Metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "Id": 2,
      "Name": "Neck",
      "Type": 8,
      "FilePath": "D:\\S2From真机导出\\E202605071749_PETWBRAW_3_20260507175822\\ListMode_BedPosition2",
      "IsEnabled": true,
      "Metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "Id": 3,
      "Name": "Chest",
      "Type": 8,
      "FilePath": "D:\\S2From真机导出\\E202605071749_PETWBRAW_3_20260507175822\\ListMode_BedPosition3",
      "IsEnabled": true,
      "Metadata": {}
    }
  ]
}


### 4. 更新病人信息（patient-info）
### 动态更新当前绑定的病人信息，支持部分字段更新
POST http://localhost:5000/api/patient-info
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "PatientName": "张三",
  "PatientId": "P20240518001",
  "AccessionNumber": "ACC-20240518-001",
  "PatientBirthDate": "1985-06-15T00:00:00",
  "PatientSex": "M",
  "PatientHeight": 175.0,
  "PatientWeight": 70.5,
  "BloodGlucose": 5.2,
  "StudyDateTime": "2024-05-18T09:30:00",
  "RequestingPhysicianName": "李医生",
  "OperatorName": "王技师",
  "ProcedureDescription": "全身PET-CT扫描",
  "PatientPosition": "HeadFirst-Supine",
  "NuclideName": "F-18",
  "TracerName": "FDG",
  "TracerMeasureTime": "2024-05-18T08:00:00",
  "TracerMeasureActivity": 12.5,
  "TracerEmptyNeedleMeasureTime": "2024-05-18T07:55:00",
  "TracerEmptyNeedleMeasureActivity": 0.5,
  "InjectionTime": "2024-05-18T08:15:00",
  "TracerDose": 8.2,
  "InjectionDate": "2024-05-18T00:00:00"
}

### 5. 通道控制（channels）
### operation="open" 模拟点击 Open channels，UI上Open按钮隐藏、Close按钮显示
### operation="close" 模拟点击 Close channels，UI上Close按钮隐藏、Open按钮显示
POST http://localhost:5000/api/channels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "open"
}


### 6. 通道控制 - 关闭（channels）
POST http://localhost:5000/api/channels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "close"
}
